58	   *
59	   * <p>Acceptable values are integer constants defined in {@link android.os.Process}, ranging from
60	   * {@link android.os.Process#THREAD_PRIORITY_LOWEST} to (-20). Any exceptions thrown will cause
61	   * the override to fail silently and disable overrides on any subsequent jobs.
62	   *
63	   * <p>Must have {@link com.bumptech.glide.GlideBuilder#setOverrideGlideThreadPriority(boolean)}
64	   * experiment enabled to be used.
65	   *
66	   * <p>This is used for a highly experimental API that may be removed in the future. Please use at
67	   * your own risk.
68	   */
69	  public static final Option<Supplier<Integer>> GLIDE_THREAD_PRIORITY_OVERRIDE =
70	      Option.memory("glide_thread_priority_override");
